("ER-003", [13,14,34,35,36,37,38,39,40,41], "Filter semantics and boundaries", "Complete ordered filter rules with defaults, hook/direction/interface, route/source-reachability data, intended-peer/services/control-policy records, and negative forbidden-flow probes. Identify unsupported rule mechanisms.", "A finite probe set is not an exhaustive allowlist proof; the importer needs complete policy and a justified implementation-to-model relation."),
